        },
        {
          "text": "Ijambo uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya yabariye Baruki mwene Neriya, igihe yandika ya majambo mu gitabo, ayakūye mu kanwa ka Yeremiya, mu mwaka ugira kane Yehoyakimu mwene Yosiya umwami w’Abayuda ari ku ngoma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
