            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku abe ari k’umubarira, ut’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngo Rāba, ico yubatse azogisambura, kand’ ico yatēragiye azokirandura: azokora artyo mu gihugu cose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
